(property "Description" " | design | W2 CTRL-6 (reviews RV-CTRL5-S-1/E-4 and RV-CTRL5-E2-2/S2-2; orchestrator decision: option (2) of build/15 \"Ключ повітродувки Q305 при КЗ\"): PTC in the blower supply, LAB5 -> F303 -> LAB5_BLOWER (J314.2, C342.1, C343.1, D306.1), so a short of the S28 lead, C342, C343 or D306 with Q305 on is limited by the PTC, not by F102 4 A (which passes 4.4 A indefinitely). Bourns MF-MSMF110/16: Vmax 16 V, Imax 100 A, Ihold 1.10 A / Itrip 2.20 A at 23 C, Ihold 1.59 A at -40 C, 1.43 A at -20 C, 0.71 A at 70 C, Rmin 0.04 ohm, R1max 0.21 ohm, 8.0 A trips in 0.3 s max, tripped dissipation 0.8 W typ (REV. BE 09/26, https://www.bourns.com/docs/Product-Datasheets/mf-msmf.pdf, read 2026-11-22). The smallest MF-MSMF whose 70 C Ihold reaches the 0.50 A blower start (E3-03); MF-MSMF075/24 holds only 0.49 A at 70 C.; Reflow soldering only, as F301 (Bourns MF-MSMF REV. BE solder reflow recommendations, read 2026-11-22)." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
